<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Zwei-Faktor-Code – Metallbau Management</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/img/icon-192.png">
  <script>
    (function() { try { var s = localStorage.getItem('darkMode'); if (s === null || s === 'true') document.documentElement.classList.add('dark'); } catch(e) {} })();
  </script>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/tailwind.min.css">
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-800 to-slate-900 flex items-center justify-center p-4">
  <div class="relative w-full max-w-md">
    <div class="text-center mb-8">
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Zwei-Faktor-Code</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-1">Bitte den 6-stelligen Code aus deiner Authenticator-App eingeben</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/20 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl p-8">
      <% if (error) { %>
        <div class="bg-red-500/20 border border-red-500/40 text-red-300 px-4 py-3 rounded-xl mb-6 text-sm"><%= error %></div>
      <% } %>
      <form action="/login/2fa" method="POST" class="space-y-5">
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Code</label>
          <input type="text" name="code" required autofocus inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="one-time-code" maxlength="12" placeholder="123456"
            class="w-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white text-center text-2xl tracking-[.4em] placeholder-slate-500 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-blue-400">
        </div>
        <button type="submit" class="w-full bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white font-semibold py-3 rounded-xl">Bestätigen →</button>
      </form>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-5">Handy nicht dabei? Hier einen der 10-stelligen <strong>Wiederherstellungscodes</strong> eingeben (z. B. AB12C-34DE5). Jeder gilt nur einmal.</p>
      <a href="/logout" class="block text-center text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-white mt-4">← Zurück zur Anmeldung</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
